<title>UK: Sainsbury prices 200 million stg bond.</title>
<headline>Sainsbury prices 200 million stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager SBC Warburg, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   J. SAINSBURY PLC</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON  ** 7.25	MATURITY    07.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.308    PAY DATE   S15.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    99.308    SPREAD	+40 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.0 PCT GILT DUE 2002</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>	   ** COUPON PREVIOUSLY INDICATED AT 7.375 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
